A. Commit message:
Fixed CVE-2024-45231 -- Avoided server error on password reset when email sending fails.

B. Change summary:
Added error handling for email sending failures in `PasswordResetForm`. If sending the password reset email fails, the exception is caught and logged instead of causing a server error. Updated documentation to reflect the changes and added a test case to ensure the exception is properly handled.

C. Compatibility Risk:
Medium

